<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Kansas City Southern.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Kansas City Southern.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Gruntal &amp; Co Inc said it upgraded Kansas City Southern Industries Inc to outperform from outperform, long-term.</p>
<p>-- raised the first quarter 1997 earnings estimate to a range of $0.70 to $0.75 a share from $0.70 a share.</p>
<p>-- raised the full year 1997 earnings estimate to $3.00 a share from $2.85 a share.</p>
<p>-- Kansas City Southern gained 3/8 to 56-1/2.</p>
<p>(( -- Wall Street desk 212-859-1730))</p>
</text>
